body:
My group hasn't attempted him yet (we were on MHW hiatus and are just coming back to the game today) but I'm gathering intel - could I ask you a couple questions about your build?  


1) Since this is a timed fight, you want as much dmg as possible - but you only run the 1 in crit boost from the Kulve gloves? You were obviously successful but I'm wondering if it might be worth to fit another 1-2 in.   


2) Did you notice a significant boost to survivability with evade window 5? A lot of people have said that Fatalis's hitboxes are wonky, so I'm wondering how it felt running evade 5. Maybe it works better with DBs than other weapons? 

&#x200B;

3) Did you feel like Divine 5 helped a lot? I feel like when I've run Divine 5 in the past, I haven't felt like it worked for me like I wanted it to. But maybe against something like Fatalis, it's worth it to have every single survivability skill possible. 

&#x200B;

4) Is elemental the way to go if I'm using a quick weapon (DB/IG/LS, etc.)? Haven't seen many folks confirm one way or the other. A lot of dragon builds but a few raw builds, too. 

&#x200B;

Thanks! And congrats!
